  "translation": "Today is Saturday. I go to the supermarket with my dad and mom to buy things. We ate breakfast first. We left home and walked for ten minutes. There were many people in the supermarket; it was very lively. We first bought fruit, including apples and bananas. Then we went to the vegetable section and bought cabbage and tomatoes. Mom also bought some beef and chicken. Dad saw special offer items; he bought three bottles of soy sauce. We strolled around the supermarket for half an hour. Later we paid and went home. After returning home, mom and dad started cooking. Dinner was very abundant; we ate too happily. I can wash dishes, so after the meal I washed the bowls."
